15. Automated Refill Lifecycle

       The complete lifecycle is:

                    ┌─────────────┐
                    │   Active    │
                    │ Subscription│
                    └──────┬──────┘
                           ↓
                    Check Refill Date
                           ↓
                    Refill Due?
                      /          \
                    No            Yes
                    │              ↓
                    │       Validate Product
                    │              ↓
                    │       Create Order
                    │              ↓
                    │       Update Status
                    │              ↓
                    │       Schedule Next
                    │              ↓
                    └───────→ Next Cycle


16. Error Handling

    Implemented handling for common refill scenarios.

    Product Out of Stock
    Refill Failed


    Product is currently unavailable.
    Invalid Subscription
    Refill cannot be processed because
    the subscription is inactive or invalid.
    Cancelled Subscription
    Refill skipped because the subscription
    has been cancelled.
    Paused Subscription
    Refill postponed because the subscription
    is currently paused.

    These statuses prevent invalid recurring orders.

